{"c":[{"id":"e6572ec977c106ea","sum":"No SQLite writes on the pattern gate's event path (one insert stalled 11 ms at load 15-69); buffer and flush on tick. A --background-only caret-fixture reports no key window, yet stdin 'focus NAME' still moves AX focus; the reader sees leave and focus walks.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T143157Z-fc39a0364b9ecb3f","text":"Pattern gate runs on the event path: no SQLite writes there (one decision-log insert stalled 11 ms at load 15-69); decisions are buffered and flushed on tick.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T160236Z-60fc41a933501ea6","text":"A --background-only (prohibited) caret-fixture reports no key window, yet stdin 'focus NAME' (makeKey + makeFirstResponder) still moves AX focus; the reader sees leave and focus walks.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e21a3ad8c4a3fa82","sum":"Pending watch: a finished job's status text and vanishing progress bar arrive in separate snapshots; keep the trailing debounce or Jev judges a half-changed window. Eval scripts: no execFileSync in polling loops (lsappinfo every 100 ms added 150-250 ms to latencies, B4).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T160237Z-6009f034277d69a2","text":"Pending watch: a finished job's status text and its vanishing progress bar arrive in separate snapshots; without the trailing debounce the first Jev answer is about a half-changed window and is stale.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T160237Z-ba6e47628dfc0d66","text":"Eval scripts: never execFileSync in a polling loop. lsappinfo every 100 ms held the in-process helper's event loop and added 150-250 ms to every measured latency (B4).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
